    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In the Burning House, rogue-like unite with your stress, the tasks of space exploration, resource allocation, and house-destroying fire to catch you off guard!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561910/extras/c64d16bc4dac5037b092ef1e90484b8f.avif?t=1748823432\" width=615 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no best item, but there are suitable ones: balance between time costs, resource expenditure and exploration</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 kinds of uninvited guests with their own habits</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible floor and walls</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkness has importance</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A little nervous</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The timer is not for hurrying you</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kung-fu in simplified mode!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random generation \u2013 you don\u2019t need to remember where you placed things. Explore again!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burning House \u2013 &quot;game with music&quot;!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seek in the darkness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The darkness has hidden the &quot;keys&quot; and &quot;doors&quot; from you\u2014find at least a match and seize a piece of fire\u2019s essence to make out the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561910/extras/f305c8779404b96c49364c8065f46a09.avif?t=1748823432\" width=615 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Look around</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house is falling apart, but find the silver lining\u2014find a way to turn the collapsing floor, falling beams, and fragile walls to your advantage. Discover useful items in the dark basement or shorten your path. Break what\u2019s still standing if it helps you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561910/extras/93111f0cceec63fe6477f28a71aae7dd.avif?t=1748823432\" width=615 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beware of the guests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are guests in the house\u2014they have come for you and are wandering around the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use their weaknesses in the chase, distract them and hide, or face the creatures in a fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561910/extras/8d6de6e5dfbbaa7296b7d57fa3dbab89.avif?t=1748823432\" width=615 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your stamina will run out, you will be overcome by pain, weakness and injuries\u2014this will simplify the hunt for the guests and reduce your chances of making it in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561910/extras/05e85a2df3b2cd400e7ae02f59931331.avif?t=1748823432\" width=615 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Know Your House</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house reconfigures every time \u2014 forget the past, explore the present.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape the inevitable</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...just do it.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In the Burning House, rogue-like unite with your stress, the tasks of space exploration, resource allocation, and house-destroying fire to catch you off guard!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561910/extras/c64d16bc4dac5037b092ef1e90484b8f.avif?t=1748823432\" width=615 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no best item, but there are suitable ones: balance between time costs, resource expenditure and exploration</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 kinds of uninvited guests with their own habits</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible floor and walls</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkness has importance</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A little nervous</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The timer is not for hurrying you</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kung-fu in simplified mode!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random generation \u2013 you don\u2019t need to remember where you placed things. Explore again!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burning House \u2013 &quot;game with music&quot;!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seek in the darkness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The darkness has hidden the &quot;keys&quot; and &quot;doors&quot; from you\u2014find at least a match and seize a piece of fire\u2019s essence to make out the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561910/extras/f305c8779404b96c49364c8065f46a09.avif?t=1748823432\" width=615 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Look around</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house is falling apart, but find the silver lining\u2014find a way to turn the collapsing floor, falling beams, and fragile walls to your advantage. Discover useful items in the dark basement or shorten your path. Break what\u2019s still standing if it helps you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561910/extras/93111f0cceec63fe6477f28a71aae7dd.avif?t=1748823432\" width=615 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beware of the guests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are guests in the house\u2014they have come for you and are wandering around the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use their weaknesses in the chase, distract them and hide, or face the creatures in a fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561910/extras/8d6de6e5dfbbaa7296b7d57fa3dbab89.avif?t=1748823432\" width=615 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your stamina will run out, you will be overcome by pain, weakness and injuries\u2014this will simplify the hunt for the guests and reduce your chances of making it in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561910/extras/05e85a2df3b2cd400e7ae02f59931331.avif?t=1748823432\" width=615 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Know Your House</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house reconfigures every time \u2014 forget the past, explore the present.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape the inevitable</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...just do it.</p>",
    "short_description": "This is a game about escape: escape from the inevitable that has caught up with you in a trap of wood and fire! Explore a house that randomly reconfigures itself every time, and with cold calculation, use everything you find in the rooms\u2014but beware of the guests... or drive them out of this world!",
